Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我发现唯一重要的是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then I realized the only thing that matters is that you--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我比我能想像的更快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You make me happier than I ever thought I could be.
