Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嫁给我好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以进来了吗  我们快要憋死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can we come in? We're dying out here!
