Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.03,0:09:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们订婚了    好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're engaged! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你们在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. What have you guys been up to?
