Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样说吧  幸好她有一个美臀  因为她不太擅长写作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well let's just say its she's lucky she's got a sweet ass. She's not so good at writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信再过4个星期  他们就要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe in four weeks they're gonna be married!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望他们能白头到老\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's just hope it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,10个里面有9个以离婚收场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y"know nine out of 1O marriages end in divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  没有的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你说的对  你太太好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you're right. How's the missus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在一起3年了  那么久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they've been together 3 years. Has it been that long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉没那么久  因为他们瞒了我们很久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Believe me, it seems like less because they hid it from us for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我  进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, it's me. Coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天辛苦了一整天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've had a very long, hard day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去买炸鸡  你要不要  不  谢了  不要炸鸡  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahh, I'm gonna go get some chicken. Want some? Ahh, no thanks. No chicken, bye-bye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay? I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不肯离开  一直问我要不要炸鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He wouldn't leave. He kept asking if I wanted chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,炸鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以来点炸鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could eat some chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要三块鸡肉  包心菜沙拉  豆子  还有可乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I get a, uh, three-piece, some cole slaw, some beans, and a Coke—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,健怡可乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Diet Coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道他们为什么不直接告诉我们  对啊  好像我们不会认同似的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know why they didn't just tell us. I know, I mean it's not like we weren't cool about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  还有你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You? And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但你不能说  没有人知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but you cannot tell anyone! No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会  什么时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.03,0:11:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在伦敦发生的  在伦敦啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It happened in London. In London?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:12:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没告诉任何人  因为我们不希望小事变大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The reason we didn't tell anyone was because we didn't want to make a big deal out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是这是大事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it is a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要告诉别人  不  不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to tell someone. No-no-no-no-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  拜托  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't. Please! Please?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还不想告诉他们  答应我你不会说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We just don't want to deal with telling everyone, okay? Just promise you won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都等不及想和你在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't wait to be with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.43,0:12:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去告诉瑞秋  我要洗几个小时的衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll just tell Rachel I'm gonna be doing laundry for a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.73,0:12:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洗衣服  那是我的新昵称吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Laundry, huh? Is that my new nickname?
