Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德和摩妮卡  我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah! Chandler and Monica! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼睛  我的眼睛  菲比  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my eyes! My eyes! Phoebe! Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  没事的  不  他们在亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay! It's okay! No! They're doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  对  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? Yes! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊也知道  但罗斯不知道  你就不要再尖叫了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Joey knows! but Ross doesn't know so you have to stop screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.11,0:13:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  老天  我们就是太兴奋  想到你会搬到这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing! Oh God, we're just so excited that you want to get this apartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  这里看起来很不错  看来很不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, it looks really good. It looks pretty good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来  这里来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get in here! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们知道你知道  但他们不知道瑞秋知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so now they know that you know and they don't know that Rachel knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但你知道吗  谁知道什么并不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but y'know what? it doesn't matter who knows what.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在有足够的人知道  就可以告诉他们我们知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, enough of us know that we can just tell them that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谎言  秘密终于可以结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then all the lying and the secrets would finally be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者我们不要告诉他们我们知道  我们就可以找点小乐子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or, we can not tell them we know and have a little fun of our own.
