Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  钱德  我已经开始想你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye, Chandler. I miss you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.62,0:14:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗  她的那些勾引了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, did you see that?! With the inappropriate pinching?
