Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你相信她被我吸引了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So now do you believe that she's attracted to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  我的天  她知道我们的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! My God, she knows about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比知道我们的事  我没有告诉她们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe knows about us! Well I didn't tell them.
