Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来要告诉你们的  可是她们要我保证不说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would've told you but they made me promise not to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们以为她们很厉害  这样耍我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh man, they think they are so slick, messing with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是  她们不知道  我们知道她们知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But see they don't know that we know that they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So... Ah, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耍人的要变成被耍的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahh yes, the messers become the mes-sees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  他要我过去  摸他的二头肌还有别的啥的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God, he wants me to come over and feel his biceps and more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信  他会对摩妮卡这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe he'd do that to Mo--
