Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道你们知道  我就知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They know you know. Ugh! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能相信这两个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh I cannot believe those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们以为可以耍我们  他们想要耍我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, they thought that they could mess with us? They're trying to mess with us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不知道我们知道  他们知道我们知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They don't know that we know they know we know.
