Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:15:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, I like that. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  给他看你的胸罩  他最怕胸罩了  他不会解胸罩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, show him your bra. He's afraid of bras. Can't work them.
